{"id":"wb-3-173","name":"浯溪摩崖石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"浯溪摩崖石刻","text":"浯溪摩崖石刻，位于湘江西岸与浯溪交汇处，距湖南省祁阳市城西约2公里。第三批全国重点文物保护单位，第一批古代名碑名刻文物，湖南省省级爱国主义教育基地。江边崖岸上刻有书画诗文词题486处。自唐以来三百多位著名人物在此题词刻诗，有元结、颜真卿、皇甫湜、黄庭坚、秦观、李清照、米芾、范成大、沈周、顾炎武等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%AF%E6%BA%AA%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB","revisionId":94224442,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94224442","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f09d884e595f80ee8bbeefbb.jpg","title":"大曆六年（771）大唐中興頌.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E6%9B%86%E5%85%AD%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%88771%EF%BC%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%94%90%E4%B8%AD%E8%88%88%E9%A0%8C.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/%E5%A4%A7%E6%9B%86%E5%85%AD%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%88771%EF%BC%89%E5%A4%A7%E5%94%90%E4%B8%AD%E8%88%88%E9%A0%8C.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"松照庵","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​顏真卿書，元結撰文。為紀念安史之亂結束而寫。大曆六年刻石。為浯溪碑林最為核心的摩崖刻石。","width":320,"height":213}}